---
import site from "../data/site.json";
import simulation from "../data/hero-media.json";
import media from "../../public/media/evtol-clips.json";
const clips = media.clips;
const overview = site.figures.find((figure) => figure.id === "overview")!;
---

<section id="media-description" class="media-description" aria-labelledby="media-heading">
  <p class="eyebrow">Real-world context and simulation</p>
  <h2 id="media-heading">Video descriptions & sources</h2>
  <section aria-labelledby="context-description-heading">
    <h3 id="context-description-heading">NASA and Joby air-taxi testing</h3>
    <p><a href={site.contextUrl}>{site.contextCredit}</a></p>
    <div id="context-visual-notes">
      {site.contextDetails.map((paragraph) => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">{site.contextLicense}{" "}<a href={site.contextLicenseUrl}>Source and media-use information</a>.</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="simulation-description-heading">
    <h3 id="simulation-description-heading">{simulation.title}</h3>
    <div id="simulation-visual-notes">
      {simulation.description.map((paragraph) => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print">{simulation.credit}</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="overview-figure-heading">
    <h3 id="overview-figure-heading">{overview.title}</h3>
    <p>{overview.description}</p>
    <p class="fine-print">{overview.credit}</p>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="excerpts-heading">
    <h3 id="excerpts-heading">Presentation videos</h3>
    <div id="excerpts-visual-description">
      {clips.map((clip) => <div class="excerpt-credit"><h4>{clip.title}</h4><p>{clip.description}</p><p>{clip.scope}</p><p class="fine-print">{clip.credit}</p></div>)}
    </div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="deck-images-heading">
    <h3 id="deck-images-heading">Presentation images</h3>
    <p>The air-mobility, eVTOL, drone-logistics, city, CFD, and Atlanta images come from the authors’ proposal defense presentation, slides 3, 4, 7, and 9. They are converted to WebP without other edits. The air-mobility, eVTOL, and drone images are illustrations, not study results.</p>
  </section>
  <p class="fine-print">All videos are silent and include text alternatives. Visible videos can play automatically; native player controls remain available to pause or resume each video. Manual pauses are remembered. Reduced-motion and data-saving preferences suppress automatic playback. The NASA/Joby recording, the outdoor drone flight, and the simulations illustrate separate settings.</p>
</section>
